# 2026-09-20: the estate's OWN autonomous loop was classified FOREGROUND and could fill
# every lane, queueing Kevin's interactive turns behind robot busywork -- exactly what
# FG_RESERVED exists to prevent, and the same defect the 2026-09-05 evalkit forensics
# found for the research feeder. The loop's clients are overseer-*, estate-entity-*,
# contract-review and queue-triage; none contained cron/batch, so none were background.
# Measured that day: identical Halo chat turns ranged 2.5s to 192s purely on contention.
SHIM_SPEND_CAP_USD=25.0
SHIM_SPEND_ENFORCE=1
SHIM_LOCAL_FIRST=1
SHIM_LOCAL_FIRST_REASONS=big-out,big-prompt,monster,perf,predicted
